<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! carriage.herm.stands ~ the wiki-less wayfarer stands the carriage crossroads

Bare `lares herm` stands a herm (Lares Viales): it spawns the same node `main.js` the vessel stand runs, routed to the herm by `--recipe herm`, detached, and waits on the node's own attestation (`vessel-ready`, or a `fatal:` line), each later boot milestone renewing a 30-second silence span. The read face listens on `--port` (else `LAR_PORT`, else 8080) and the carriage relay (Socket B) on `--relay-port` (else `LAR_HERM_RELAY_PORT`, else 8090). On a live stand it echoes the node's own dial URLs and relay gate key, so the operator hands a hearth what to dial.

A stand never hard-fails the session: it exits 0 and `ok` carries the verdict. Where the host holds the engine, where the node dist stands unbuilt, or where no bootstrap stands, nothing spawns and the note names the cure. A word the door does not answer refuses before anything stands, so a typo never raises a herm.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ port · relay-port

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`port` params=`takes/port default/8080 ~ the read face's http port; else LAR_PORT`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`relay-port` params=`takes/port default/8090 ~ the carriage relay's port (Socket B); else LAR_HERM_RELAY_PORT`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ local

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`local` params=`who/hand ~ spawns the herm on this host's own root; this handler checks no ocap`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`~ the door answers relay-rotate alone; any other word refuses before a herm stands`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ live · down

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`live` params=`exit/0 fields/[[herm relay root bootstrap timestamp]] ~ the herm attested vessel-ready; relay.gateKey and relay.dial name what a hearth dials`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`down` params=`exit/0 fields/[[herm relay root bootstrap timestamp]] ~ nothing stands live; herm.note names the preflight cure, the fault, or the log to read`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

